WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.390
- Well, speaking about your bubble,

00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:02.810
is your wife, Deborah Roberts,

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:05.170
doing "Good Morning
America" from there as well.

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:06.003
- Yeah, yeah.

00:00:06.003 --> 00:00:06.836
In fact, we,

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.030
there've been a number of times,

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:12.894
we've literally been on the same time.

00:00:12.894 --> 00:00:13.970
- Oh.

00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:16.530
- Like I'm in here and
she's in the living room.

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:18.380
Now that was like when it was colder,

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:21.480
I've now moved out in front of the garage,

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:22.313
but you know--

00:00:22.313 --> 00:00:24.092
- She kicked you out
to the garage? (laughs)

00:00:24.092 --> 00:00:26.007
It's like, "Today Show's" got the garage.

00:00:26.007 --> 00:00:27.592
"Good Morning America's"
got the living room.

00:00:27.592 --> 00:00:28.633
(laughs)

00:00:28.633 --> 00:00:29.466
- What are you gonna do?

00:00:29.466 --> 00:00:30.410
What are you gonna do?

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:31.243
- That's amazing.

00:00:31.243 --> 00:00:32.440
That's very kind of you.

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:34.270
- I was looking back at the,

00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:36.360
when you were just getting
ready to start the show

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:38.920
and you guys had just bought your ranch.

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:40.730
- Oh, in Montana, yeah.

00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:42.860
- So, thank God you did, geez.

00:00:42.860 --> 00:00:44.500
- I know, that's where we went.

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:47.020
Yeah, we were there for two months.

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:47.890
Um, yeah.

00:00:47.890 --> 00:00:50.280
But Al, do you ever walk behind her

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:52.130
or mess with your wife's shot ever?

00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:53.870
Just 'cause, you know, you're competing.

00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:55.440
- You know, I have.

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:58.920
There was one point where she
was doing something with Nick

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:01.000
and I wanted to take a picture

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:02.800
and I thought I had the right angle

00:01:03.770 --> 00:01:07.377
and all of a sudden I
hear a Robin Roberts go,

00:01:07.377 --> 00:01:09.300
"Oh, is that an Al Roker sighting?"

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:10.159
I'm like.

00:01:10.159 --> 00:01:11.060
(laughs)

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:12.503
So I decided to just own it.

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:16.350
- Yeah, and you're like,
"Oh, my bad." (laughs)

00:01:16.350 --> 00:01:17.183
That's awesome.

